"dictionaries."
msgstr "Ako vi odaberite ovaj okvir  novi rječnik je created pomoću merging existing rječnici."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, fileButton)
#: wordcompletion/creationsourceui.ui:50
#, kde-format
msgid "From &file"
msgstr "Iz &datoteka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QRadioButton, fileButton)
#: wordcompletion/creationsourceui.ui:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If you select this box a new dictionary is created by loading a file. You "
"may either select an XML file, a standard text file or a file containing a "
"word completion dictionary. If you select a standard text file or an XML "
"file the frequentness of the individual words is detected by simply counting "
"the occurrences of each word."
msgstr "Ako vi odaberite ovaj okvir  novi rječnik je created pomoću učitavanje  datoteka. Vi may either odaberite  XML datoteka,  standardni tekst datoteka ili  datoteka containing  riječ dovršavanje rječnik. Ako vi odaberite  standardni tekst datoteka ili  XML datoteka  frequentness od  pojedinačni riječi je detected pomoću simply counting  occurrences od svaki riječ."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, kdeDocButton)
#: wordcompletion/creationsourceui.ui:71
#, kde-format
msgid "From &KDE documentation"
msgstr "Iz &KDE documentation"

